[Section] Experiments
[source_id=29] We evaluated our models on 3 different datasets:
[source_id=30] CSAT dataset for CSAT prediction, consisting of spoken transcripts (automatic via ASR).
[source_id=31] 20 newsgroups for topic identification task, consisting of written text;
[source_id=32] Fisher Phase 1 corpus for topic identification task, consisting of spoken transcripts (manual);
